 78-Pt-193 LANL       EVAL-MAY24 M.Herman & T.Kawano              7834 1451
                      DIST-AUG24 REV1-JUN24            20240830   7834 1451
---- ENDF/B-VIII.1    MATERIAL 7834         REVISION 1            7834 1451
